<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In CreativeBench: Benchmarking and Enhancing Machine Creativity via Self-Evolving Challenges" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>Additional Analysis</span></a>
