<td id="A6.T4.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">0.38%</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T4.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T4.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">Moderate comment-only length increase (184 <math id="A6.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> 801 chars)</td>
