<figure id="A7.T10" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A7.T10.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A7.T10.2.1" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;">
<td id="A7.T10.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A7.T10.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;">
<span id="A7.T10.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T10.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">CreativeBench-Explore: Constraint Compliance Checker</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T10.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T10.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.2.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p2.1" class="ltx_p">You are a code compliance verifier for a creativity benchmark system.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p4.1" class="ltx_p">## Context</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.5.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.5.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.5.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p5.1" class="ltx_p">We are evaluating AI models’ exploratory creativity by constraining their code generation.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.6.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.6.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.6.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Models must find alternative solutions when common approaches are blocked, demonstrating their ability to explore</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.7" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p7.1" class="ltx_p">the solution space creatively.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.8" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.9" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p9.1" class="ltx_p">## Your Task</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.10" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.10.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.10.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.10.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p10.1" class="ltx_p">Verify whether the provided code complies with the given constraint. This is critical for ensuring the model truly explored alternative approaches rather than using the blocked technique.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.11" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.12" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p12" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p12.1" class="ltx_p">## Code to Verify</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.13" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.13.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p13" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p13.1" class="ltx_p">```&lt;&lt;&lt;LANGUAGE&gt;&gt;&gt;</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.14" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.14.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p14" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p14.1" class="ltx_p">&lt;&lt;&lt;CODE&gt;&gt;&gt;</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.15" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.15.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p15" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p15.1" class="ltx_p">```</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.16" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.16.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.17" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.17.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p17" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p17.1" class="ltx_p">## Constraint to Check</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.18" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.18.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p18" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p18.1" class="ltx_p">**Constraint**: &lt;&lt;&lt;CONSTRAINT&gt;&gt;&gt;</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.19" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.19.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p19" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p19.1" class="ltx_p">**Blocked Technique**: &lt;&lt;&lt;BLOCKED_TECHNIQUE&gt;&gt;&gt;</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.20" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.20.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p20" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p20.1" class="ltx_p">**Verification Hint**: &lt;&lt;&lt;VERIFICATION_HINT&gt;&gt;&gt;</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.21" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.21.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.22" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.22.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.22.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p22" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p22.1" class="ltx_p">## Verification Process</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.23" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.23.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.23.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.23.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.23.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.23.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p23" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p23.1" class="ltx_p">1. **Identify Violation Patterns**: Look for any code patterns that use the blocked technique.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.24" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.24.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.24.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.25" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.25.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.25.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.25.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.25.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.25.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A7.T10.p25" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.T10.p25.1" class="ltx_p">2. **Check for Workarounds**: Ensure the solution doesn’t simply rename or wrap the blocked technique.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.26" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.26.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A7.T10.2.2.1.1.26.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
