<span id="A10.T13.p24.1" class="ltx_p">   - No exception handling with try/except</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A10.T13.2.2.1.1.25" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T13.2.2.1.1.25.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T13.2.2.1.1.25.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
