</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.35" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.35.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.35.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.36" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.36.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.36.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.36.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.36.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.36.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A10.T14.p36" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A10.T14.p36.1" class="ltx_p">1.  **Language Specification:** Explicitly state that solutions must be implemented in **Python**.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.37" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.37.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.37.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.37.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.37.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.37.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A10.T14.p37" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A10.T14.p37.1" class="ltx_p">2.  **Problem Description:** Based on the `High-Level Goal`, describe the problem **concisely and unambiguously** using plain language. Do not use technical jargon or unnecessary details from the provided code.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.38" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.38.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.38.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.38.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.38.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.38.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A10.T14.p38" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A10.T14.p38.1" class="ltx_p">3.  **Function/Class Naming:** The problem statement must only mention the **exact function or class names** that are necessary to solve the problem, as found in the test functions.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.39" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.39.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.39.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.39.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.39.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.39.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A10.T14.p39" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A10.T14.p39.1" class="ltx_p">4.  **Input/Output Format:** Clearly define the **input format** (types, structure, value ranges) and the **expected output format**. Specify any constraints (e.g., input size limits).</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.40" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.40.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.40.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.40.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.40.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.40.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A10.T14.p40" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A10.T14.p40.1" class="ltx_p">5.  **Example Usage:** Use the test case(s) from the `[Test Function Demo]` section to construct a clear example. Copy the example usage verbatim without modification or explanation.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.41" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.41.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.41.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.41.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.41.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.41.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A10.T14.p41" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A10.T14.p41.1" class="ltx_p">6.  **Strictly No Hints:** The problem description **must not** reveal any part of the solution’s implementation logic, internal variables, or any test cases beyond what is in the provided examples.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.42" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.42.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.42.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.42.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.42.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.42.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A10.T14.p42" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A10.T14.p42.1" class="ltx_p">7.  **Self-Contained and Solvable:** The problem description must be self-contained, providing all necessary rules and conditions for a developer to solve it without making assumptions. Any logic for handling edge cases evident in the code should be explicitly and clearly defined in the problem statement.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.43" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.43.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.43.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.44" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.44.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.44.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A10.T14.p44" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A10.T14.p44.1" class="ltx_p">### 6\. Final Output</span>
