<span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.46" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.46.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.46.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.46.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.46.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A10.T14.2.2.1.1.46.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A10.T14.p46" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A10.T14.p46.1" class="ltx_p">Please enclose the entire generated programming problem within `&lt;question&gt;` and `&lt;/question&gt;` tags.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
