<span id="A10.T15.p12.1" class="ltx_p">Output format:</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A10.T15.2.2.1.1.13" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T15.2.2.1.1.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A10.T15.2.2.1.1.13.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A10.T15.p13" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
