<section id="A11" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix K </span>Data Construct Prompts: Explore Pipeline</h2>

<div id="A11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As shown in Table <a href="#A11.T16" title="Table 16 ‣ Appendix K Data Construct Prompts: Explore Pipeline ‣ CreativeBench: Benchmarking and Enhancing Machine Creativity via Self-Evolving Challenges" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>–Table <a href="#A11.T18" title="Table 18 ‣ Appendix K Data Construct Prompts: Explore Pipeline ‣ CreativeBench: Benchmarking and Enhancing Machine Creativity via Self-Evolving Challenges" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>, this block supports exploratory data construction via constrained generation, technique mining, and compliance verification.</p>
</div>
