</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T16.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T16.p3.1" class="ltx_p">## The Challenge</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.4.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.4.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.4.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T16.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T16.p4.1" class="ltx_p">This benchmark evaluates your ability to demonstrate exploratory creativity - finding novel, unconventional solutions when standard approaches are blocked. True creativity emerges when constraints force you to explore uncharted solution spaces.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T16.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T16.p6.1" class="ltx_p">## Problem to Solve</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.7" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T16.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T16.p7.1" class="ltx_p">&lt;&lt;&lt;PROBLEM_DESCRIPTION&gt;&gt;&gt;</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.8" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.9" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T16.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T16.p9.1" class="ltx_p">## Required Function Signature</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.10" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T16.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T16.p10.1" class="ltx_p">Your solution MUST use this exact function signature:</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.11" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
