<span id="A11.T16.p13.1" class="ltx_p">## Progressive Constraints</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.14" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.14.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.14.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.14.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.14.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T16.p14" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T16.p14.1" class="ltx_p">You must solve this problem while adhering to ALL of the following constraints:</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.15" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.15.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
