<span id="A11.T16.p18.1" class="ltx_p">&lt;&lt;&lt;FEEDBACK_HISTORY&gt;&gt;&gt;</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.19" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.19.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.20" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.20.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T16.p20" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T16.p20.1" class="ltx_p">## Your Mission</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.21" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.21.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.21.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.21.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.21.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T16.p21" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T16.p21.1" class="ltx_p">1. **Think Creatively**: These constraints are designed to block common solutions. Embrace this as an opportunity to discover novel approaches.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.22" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.22.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.22.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.23" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.23.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.23.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.23.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.23.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T16.2.2.1.1.23.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T16.p23" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T16.p23.1" class="ltx_p">2. **Explore Alternatives**: Consider unconventional techniques, mathematical properties, language features, or algorithmic tricks you might not normally use.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
