<span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T18.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T18.p5.1" class="ltx_p">## Context</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.6.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.6.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.6.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T18.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T18.p6.1" class="ltx_p">We are evaluating AI models’ exploratory creativity by constraining their code generation. Models must find alternative solutions when common approaches are blocked, demonstrating their ability to explore the solution space creatively.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.7" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.8" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T18.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T18.p8.1" class="ltx_p">## Your Task</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.9" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.9.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.9.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.9.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T18.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T18.p9.1" class="ltx_p">Verify whether the provided code complies with the given constraint. This is critical for ensuring the model truly explored alternative approaches rather than using the blocked technique.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
