<span id="A11.T18.p21" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T18.p21.1" class="ltx_p">## Verification Process</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.22" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.22.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.22.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.22.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.22.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.22.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T18.p22" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T18.p22.1" class="ltx_p">1. **Identify Violation Patterns**: Look for any code patterns that use the blocked technique.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.23" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.23.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.23.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.24" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.24.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.24.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.24.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.24.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.24.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T18.p24" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T18.p24.1" class="ltx_p">2. **Check for Workarounds**: Ensure the solution doesn’t simply rename or wrap the blocked technique.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.25" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.25.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.25.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.26" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.26.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.26.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T18.p26" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T18.p26.1" class="ltx_p">## Output Format</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.27" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.27.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.27.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T18.p27" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.T18.p27.1" class="ltx_p">Provide your verification result in the following format:</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.28" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.28.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.28.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.29" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.29.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A11.T18.2.2.1.1.29.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A11.T18.p29" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
