<span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.12" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.12.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.12.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.12.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.12.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A12.T19.p12" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A12.T19.p12.1" class="ltx_p">gpt_setting (verifier) = "You are a strict code compliance verifier."</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.13" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.13.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A12.T19.p13" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A12.T19.p13.1" class="ltx_p">gpt_setting (solver)   = "You are a creative problem solver."</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.14" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.14.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.15" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.15.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A12.T19.p15" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A12.T19.p15.1" class="ltx_p">baseline prompt (generate_baseline_solution):</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.16" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.16.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A12.T19.p16" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A12.T19.p16.1" class="ltx_p">"You are an expert {language} programmer."</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.17" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.17.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.17.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.17.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.17.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A12.T19.p17" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A12.T19.p17.1" class="ltx_p">"Solve the following problem using exactly the given function signature."</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.18" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.18.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.18.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.18.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.18.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A12.T19.p18" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A12.T19.p18.1" class="ltx_p">"Return only a single code block with the implementation, no extra text."</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.19" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.19.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.20" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.20.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.20.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.20.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.20.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:306.8pt;">
<span id="A12.T19.p20" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A12.T19.p20.1" class="ltx_p">reference append block (generate_with_constraints, use_reference=True):</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.21" class="ltx_p" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:327.8pt;"><span id="A12.T19.2.2.1.1.21.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
